    "description": "As Kenya continues to grapple with Covid-19 and its citizens adjust to life in self-isolation, the far-reaching implications of this pandemic continue to unroll. Severe implications have been felt on our ways of life - massive strain on an already compromised healthcare system, millions of children sent home from school and layoffs due to the economic drop.",
